WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
This is the real Cortisol+ app in an iPhone Simulator.
All readings are sample data from a development build.

00:10.000 --> 00:22.000
The dashboard's 26 is a software wellness score.
The “Low” label is not a measured cortisol level.

00:22.000 --> 00:34.000
The detail view shows example inputs:
HRV 58 ms, sleep 7.8 hours and resting heart rate 58 bpm.

00:34.000 --> 00:45.000
The bars show saved example readings at different times.
Changes in this score do not establish a hormone change.

00:45.000 --> 00:58.000
Back on the dashboard, open the Sleep tab
to inspect sleep duration, timing and stages.

00:58.000 --> 01:10.000
Development fixtures can differ between these screens.
Sleep estimates do not establish why sleep changed.
